BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Theme Class - African Dance with John
DTSTART:20261114T150000Z
DTEND:20261114T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261110T160000Z
LOCATION:Cremerstraat 253\, 3532 BS Utrecht
DESCRIPTION:John Kayongo of Studio Lionpaw is giving a workshop in traditional African dance. Expect infectious music\, explosive movement\, clear guidance from an experienced teacher\, and dances passed down through generations in East\, Central and Southern Africa. John will take you through the meaning behind the movements\, because these dances are far more than beautiful choreography. No experience needed: everyone can join in. Dance together\, feel the connection and discover what Ubuntu means: "I am because we are."
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/EiF3bQ4haTpKNsJu5
UID:theme-class-sat-african@swingdom2026
END:VEVENT
